10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YE0SVIRYDUYQ7kNvwH6WF-e&_nc_oc=AdosJ3RAU8TcWHFiqD0Q4_pQ_7WdvYAnt6Jx0lItn4qklqqItWYBOa5a57O4sAyW6ys&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxxK-98AfQFxuCd9JDXd6CbnzzLT9BikyDooS0QDPzwXQ&oe=69C29ECC"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PMXWZ9EDlIoQ7kNvwHu1G2N&_nc_oc=Adpr1zbwP7xmOj5Psxm01s9-jpoIqbySDM1DJxrRVjIv27oq2DDSyUenAMIUN6fnaLQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyDT4NQhtZ2LOAhXNb7qFwhLWQNckZq5mdVlq7MO9di6Q&oe=69C2777C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E4klXsdEhioQ7kNvwHT7ptO&_nc_oc=Adr1la2h9shm7Z5leGvRS7YdAwzoLK8rRUwd-mcaByeHBr5ziRoPebn0zIbKh9oQcu4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfymewY-G029cBUnE4NcPiFG6iV8dJs_eeIiB8nr7JZxPg&oe=69C28EAB"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore